Package: goldval
Title: Clinical Prediction Validation with Error-Prone Outcomes and Partial Gold Review
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Goldval", "Developers", email = "dev@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Goldval Developers
Maintainer: Goldval Developers <dev@example.com>
Description: Provides workflow tools for validating fixed clinical prediction
    models when a proxy outcome is observed for the full validation cohort and a
    gold-standard outcome is observed only for a reviewed subset.
